invalid type: string "# Overfitting\n\nOverfitting occurs when a model memorizes training data.\n\nAn overfitted model performs poorly on unseen data.\n\nTraining accuracy becomes very high.\n\nTesting accuracy becomes lower.\n\nComplex models are more likely to overfit.\n\nSmall datasets increase overfitting risk.\n\nNoise in data can also cause overfitting.\n\nRegularization reduces overfitting.